 Art Year 6 Art\n\u00a9 2026 Orchards Junior School Legal Information\nWebsite Design by Greenhouse School Websites\nFacebook\nInstagram\nParentpay\nClass Dojo\nWrap-around Care\nAdmissions 2026/2027","listItems":["Facebook","Instagram","Parentpay","Class Dojo","Wrap-around Care","Admissions 2026/2027"],"meta":{"pageType":"substantive","sectionCount":"1","listItemCount":"6"}},{"url":"https://www.orchardsjunior.school/Curriculum/Aspen-Class-Special-Support-Centre/","finalUrl":"https://www.orchardsjunior.school/Curriculum/Aspen-Class-Special-Support-Centre/","fetchedAt":"2026-09-08","contentLength":26984,"contentHash":"a7b222a1c823a0082ce499fe6ad63d4285e357e5f8e3c76ce6c20d9588c92ba0","textHash":"66709036432dde9d1d3e9df5bc7f7608100268ff7a16b56e232a7fb6897c9f3d","pageTitle":"Orchards Junior School - Special Support Centre - Aspen Class","section":"curriculum","text":"Aspen Class - Special Support Centre\nAspen Class, the Orchards Special Support Centre, supports children with Speech, Language and Communication Needs. It offers up to 15 places for pupils who have an Education, Health and Care Plan (EHCP) identifying severe speech and language difficulties as their primary need. Decisions about admission are made by the West Sussex Special Assessment Team, in consultation with the Head Teacher, Teacher in Charge and the Speech and Language Therapist.\nChildren are provided with a curriculum that is carefully adapted in both pace and content to meet the needs of those with speech and language disorders. It is delivered within a communication\u2011friendly environment by skilled, well\u2011trained and experienced staff.\nStaff work in partnership with parents, external professionals, mainstream colleagues and peers to ensure each child\u2019s individual needs are met, creating a balanced approach that supports their social and emotional well-being alongside their academic development.\nInclusion is a core value for us. We make sure every pupil has genuine opportunities to mix with, and form friendships within, their mainstream class\u2014rather than just those who attend the SSC. Children in Aspen Class are celebrated for their strengths in other areas of the curriculum also and given the opportunity, if they wish, to perform on stage, to attend a specially organised afterschool club and to participate in SEND activities both internally and externally, where they can represent their school. This is all supported by a nurturing and encouraging trained team.\n\u00a9 2026 Orchards Junior School Legal Information\nWebsite Design by Greenhouse School Websites\nFacebook\nInstagram\nParentpay\nClass Dojo\nWrap-around Care\nAdmissions 2026/2027","listItems":["Facebook","Instagram","Parentpay","Class Dojo","Wrap-around Care","Admissions 2026/2027"],"meta":{"pageType":"substantive","sectionCount":"1","listItemCount":"6"}},{"url":"https://www.orchardsjunior.school/Curriculum/Computing/","finalUrl":"https://www.orchardsjunior.school/Curriculum/Computing/","fetchedAt":"2026-09-08","contentLength":23620,"contentHash":"b1a89ab8d500846f61422eefb450ca0ea0de9690a93b8db442525c1054dcb7a4","textHash":"055368e8d5386b125c44de31308b37cb3c0d11089043310f536dfee93d0bda48","pageTitle":"Orchards Junior School - Computing","section":"curriculum","text":"Computing\nSubject overview for ICT:\nYear 3 Computing Year 4 Computing\nYear 5 Computing Year 6 Computing\n\u00a9 2026 Orchards Junior School Legal Information\nWebsite Design by Greenhouse School Websites\nFacebook\nInstagram\nParentpay\nClass Dojo\nWrap-around Care\nAdmissions 2026/2027","listItems":["Facebook","Instagram","Parentpay","Class Dojo","Wrap-around Care","Admissions 2026/2027"],"meta":{"pageType":"substantive","sectionCount":"1","listItemCount":"6"}},{"url":"https://www.orchardsjunior.school/Curriculum/English/","finalUrl":"https://www.orchardsjunior.school/Curriculum/English/","fetchedAt":"2026-09-08","contentLength":23569,"contentHash":"ddb46824ecfb5d57321ac94ce525256f10501e6f77fcc2de47981bfc847806